One caveat recorded in [38;5;10mtranslation/ERRORS.md[0m: the silent bad branch is a property of this GCC build, not of C itself, since returning a stack address is undefined behavior. The tests compare against whatever [38;5;10mc_src/build/driver[0m actually does, so a toolchain with different codegen would surface as a failure rather than a silent wrong pass.[0m[0m
